ma_rwz_filter.svg: Fig. 3 (file RWZ.pdf) of S. Ma et al., "Quasinormal-mode filters: a new
approach to analyze the gravitational-wave ringdown of binary black-hole mergers",
arXiv:2207.10870 (v2 source), converted with `pdftocairo -svg RWZ.pdf`. Unmodified.
Upper panels: Re h22 (black) and Re h22 filtered by F_220 (red) for a Schwarzschild BH
perturbed by a Gaussian pulse; lower panels: their difference.
